    "body": "Pushed ae9d556c (PR is still a draft): the first version lifted with G53 G0 Z0 before each tool change and at the end. On a grblHAL machine without homing (\\\\=0\\) machine Z0 is the power-on height, so that lift could rapid down into the part. Now G53 is used only when the machine file states safe_retract; otherwise the lift is G0 Z<clearance> in the work offset, refused by name when unknown or not above the stock. Decision record and PR body updated. Re-gated: same 28 app binaries + post comp + ui filters green, goldens unchanged.",
