    "body": "Pushed 6129a904 (still a draft): review item addressed. Merged upstream/main (clean; smoothing #616/#635 landed there after this branch). grblhal.cps now reads PARAM Smoothing/SmoothingMode and writes one named note, `SMOOTHING NOT WRITTEN - GRBLHAL STATES NO SMOOTHING TOLERANCE`, per program, resetting the ask per section; `smoothing.rs` pins it for grblHAL alongside Fanuc/Mazak; decision file updated. Also dropped the G85 claim from the cycle comment (listed by grblHAL, never mapped here).\n\nTargeted gate (debug, head 6129a904): smoothing 6/6, grblhal_post 9/9, conformance 6/6, machine 33/33, posting 17/17, after_op 10/10, coolant 7/7, fanuc_post 11/11, camcraft-post comp 9/9; `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-post --all-targets -- -D warnings` clean. Goldens unchanged.\n\nThe Carvera post has the same smoothing gap, as the review noted; that belongs in a separate issue.\n\nReady for a re-check.",
