    "body": "Pushed e419579f (still a draft): merged upstream/main again (4865500d). Conflicts were additive only - posting.rs BUILTINS and conformance.rs POSTS keep main's Doosan DNM beside grblHAL (same order in both), smoothing.rs keeps the Carvera #757 note in the header.\n\nGate note: upstream/main itself does not compile right now (#844, trochoid_slot.rs vs measure()'s new Result from #783), so the gate ran on a throwaway merge of this branch with 9e4cc359, the last main before that break. That main already has Doosan and Carvera smoothing, and the PR's files there are identical to e419579f. Debug: smoothing 7/7, grblhal_post 9/9, doosan_dnm_post 7/7, carvera_post 4/4, conformance 6/6, machine 33/33, posting 17/17, after_op 10/10, coolant 7/7, fanuc_post 11/11, camcraft-post comp 9/9; clippy -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-post --all-targets -D warnings clean. Goldens unchanged.\n\nReady for a re-check once #844 lands.",
