    "body": "Pushed c9822758: merged upstream/main (62a2c93a, clean - #844 is fixed by #848, so main compiles again) and regenerated two grblHAL goldens.\n\n**Golden change:** `grblhal/contour_disc_hole.nc` and `grblhal/contour_tangential_lead.nc` were stale after the #689 arc-fit change (upstream cd5c3885 regenerated the CL goldens, but the grblHAL NC goldens were made on this branch before that). Regenerated with `WRITE_GOLDEN=1`; only those two files changed, and their XY point sets match `carvera/` on main exactly - lead-in/lead-out geometry only, no post-logic change.\n\n**Gate** (debug, head c9822758 / merge 565e83ef): grblhal_post 9/9, conformance 6/6, smoothing 7/7, machine 33/33, posting 17/17, after_op 10/10, coolant 7/7, fanuc_post 12/12, carvera_post 4/4, doosan_dnm_post 9/9, camcraft-post comp 9/9; `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-post --all-targets -- -D warnings` clean.\n\nAll earlier review items are addressed (branch refresh, smoothing note, G85 comment). Flagging ready for a re-check.\n",
